  Jobs --> Regression[Replay probe regression]
  Jobs --> Procedure[Validate procedure]
  Jobs --> SourceAudit[Refresh source anchors]
  Jobs --> Boundary[Context boundary drill]

  Consolidate --> Claims[Claim/evidence ledger]
  Procedure --> Skills[Procedure skill memory]
  Regression --> Calibration[Metamemory calibration]
  SourceAudit --> Review[Review candidates]
  Boundary --> Context[Context binding updates]

  Skills --> Workflow[Workflow/template promotion\nonly after validation policy]
